00:01:36.621 --> 00:01:40.710
My name is Simon Sinek,
and I have a clear vision

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:42.350
of what I wanna build in this world.

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:44.210
I imagine a world in
which the vast majority

00:01:44.210 --> 00:01:46.110
