at the end of the day,

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.860
and everything I do, whether it's writing,

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.600
speaking, teaching, whatever it is,

00:01:54.600 --> 00:01:56.470
is devoted to helping to build that world.

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.700
