black-and-white version of that.

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:53.470
I think that you can continue
to make incremental steps,

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:54.607
but I think that there are people--

00:16:54.607 --> 00:16:55.900
- Oh, so there's a diminishing
returns kinda thing.

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:57.136
Yeah, that's interesting.
