00:17:06.563 --> 00:17:07.660
- And the question is, where is everybody?

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:09.460
If here is the max-out

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:10.923
or the diminishing returns--
- Right.

00:17:10.923 --> 00:17:12.090
- The question is, is--

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:12.923
- Do you stop here?

00:17:12.923 --> 00:17:14.070
